  <h1>LurkVR Privacy Policy</h1>

  <p>Last updated: September 11, 2026</p>

  <p>LurkVR is a virtual reality game developed by RiflePulse.</p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>LurkVR does not intentionally collect or store personal information unless this is specifically required for a feature of the game.</p>

  <h2>How Information Is Used</h2>
  <p>If information is collected for a game feature, it is used only to provide and improve that feature.</p>

  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>LurkVR may use platform services provided by Meta to support features such as VR functionality, account services, and distribution of the game.</p>

  <h2>Data Deletion</h2>
  <p>If LurkVR stores personal information in the future, information about how to request deletion will be provided here.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions regarding LurkVR, please contact the developer through the official LurkVR channels.</p>
